id: og_roundhouse_c
name: Roundhouse III
description: Roundhouse. Engine stalls all facing one turntable, so the middle of the building is both the only way between any two of them and the worst place in it to be standing. Built as a locomotive shed; the table was left off its stops with an engine half on it.

grid: 1.8
wall_thickness: 0.32

layer pits z=-3.4 height=2.80 roof=yes

legend
